Hana, Ruth,

Release 2026.03.1 went out at 16:00 today; no incidents, no rollbacks. Draft customer-facing notes below. Could one of you do a wording pass by tomorrow 10:00, then Ruth posts to the help center and the in-app changelog? Nobody outside the two of you needs to do anything.

Draft:

New
- Spec references on lot records. Add a specification ID and revision to any lot; it appears on the lot page and in the CSV export. (Requested by a quality team preparing for an AS9100 audit.)
- Export history. Every scheduled export now shows its last 30 runs, with status and row counts, under Reports > Scheduled exports.

Improved
- Late-lot alerts are grouped. If the same station trips several times within ten minutes you now get one alert with a count, e.g. "Station 3B late (x4)", instead of four texts.
- Clearer error message when an ingest feed's column count changes.

Fixed
- Plant names with accented characters no longer break the PDF shift report.
- The shift board no longer scrolls to the top after a filter change.

Avery, Tomás: FYI only.

Jordan
